*Envelope Detector with Low-Pass Filter
*- Used to demodulate amplitude-modulated (AM) signals
*- Very cheap and easy to build
Ro N001 amp 75
D1 amp env D1
R2 env out 10k
Bi in 0 V=(1+0.5*sin(2*pi*1k*time))*sin(2*pi*20k*time)
Ri in 0 100k
Eo N001 0 in 0 8
R1 env 0 10k
C1 env 0 20n
C2 out 0 15n
.model D1 D(Vfwd=0.7)
.tran 1n 4m 1m
.end
